<title>LITHUANIA: BIRZHU PIPELINE JULY OIL VOLUMES RISE.</title>
<headline>BIRZHU PIPELINE JULY OIL VOLUMES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian oil transporter Birzhu Pipelines said on Wednesday that it transported 2.12 million tonnes of crude oil and related products in July and 13.2 million tonnes in the first seven months of the year.</p>
</text>
